      "sourceTextSha256": "3926e0c8cb2ed408f56c89f1569ea3abca17a8605a5d72dd71cf392bfaa0b75b",
      "text": "An early transfer to Sierpe, then a boat trip down the Sierpe River through mangrove wetlands to Rancho Corcovado, where a welcome cocktail awaits before lunch. The afternoon is free for nature trails and the best beach spots. Overnight at Rancho Corcovado. (B, L, D)",
